# GOV-02 Workflow

Use GitHub Issues for delivery scope and map each issue to active specification
sections. Make intentional changes in small commits, push every commit, and
open a pull request to `develop`. Do not merge, deploy, publish, or make GA
claims from a development branch.

Before code changes, ensure project intent, an active specification, backlog
mapping, `INIT-TODO.md`, and strict Git workflow artifacts exist. Record
unavailable external dependencies as blockers rather than imitating them.
